OL,3,AEurope wrestles with impact of historic
OL,4,Aregional gains for Germany's AfD
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Seismic", "a socio-political
OL,7,Fearthquake", "a watershed moment for
OL,8,FGermany".
OL,10,FThis was how political analysts and
OL,11,Fmany media outlets described the
OL,12,Fstunning victory of the
OL,13,Fanti-immigration Alternative for
OL,14,FGermany (AfD) party in local elections
OL,15,Fin Germany on Sunday. Is that an
OL,16,Fexaggeration?
