OL,3,AEurope wrestles with impact of historic
OL,4,Aregional gains for Germany's AfD
OL,5,
OL,6,FSaxony-Anhalt is one of the smallest of
OL,7,Fmassive Germany's 16 regions. It boasts
OL,8,Fa mere 1.7m out of 59m eligible voters
OL,9,Fnationwide. How significant can its
OL,10,Fpolitical sentiments be, especially
OL,11,Fsince the AfD narrowly failed to win an
OL,12,Foutright majority?
OL,14,FThe answer: very significant.
